OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner dismayed as bypass plan
OL,4,Ais dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner has accused the government
OL,7,Fof a lack of "understanding" after
OL,8,Fplans for a long-awaited bypass were
OL,9,Fdropped from a national funding
OL,10,Fprogramme.
OL,12,FThe A509 Isham bypass was first
OL,13,Fproposed in 2003 by the now-defunct
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire County Council, but it
OL,15,Fwas delayed by funding problems.
