OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner dismayed as bypass plan
OL,4,Ais dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, it was removed from the
OL,7,FMajor Road Network and Large Local
OL,8,FMajors Programme, after a review by the
OL,9,FDepartment for Transport (DfT), which
OL,10,Fsaid it could only go ahead with
OL,11,Fschemes that were "good value for
OL,12,Fmoney".
OL,14,FGraham Rait, a long-term campaigner for
OL,15,Fthe bypass, said: "I think they're
OL,16,Ftaking value for money in terms of
OL,17,Fperhaps industry."
